OL,3,GNEWSA'Serious administrative error' in
OL,4,Aelection count
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeputy returning officer Jeremy Callin,
OL,7,Fwho carried out both counts, said he
OL,8,Faccepted "complete responsibility" for
OL,9,Fthe error, but concluded it did not
OL,10,Fchange the outcome of the election.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
